219 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 146 0 R
/E (Supplied. 6 CSV files, 3 train and 3 test. Columns: utc_time, x_error, y_error, z_error, satclockerror. After de-duplication, 46 / 143 / 142 training rows at 13 to 32% coverage. No satellite identifier, only orbit class.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
220 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 146 0 R
/E (Generated. Three supplied windows cannot show that a model works. 120 generated ones, each with a known answer, can. Every term is a documented physical effect: a fixed offset, harmonics at the derived beat periods, drift between uploads, measurement noise, and a clock built as a random walk with resets, sampled at the delivered files' own timestamps and gaps.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
221 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 146 0 R
/E (Tech Stack: Python, numpy, pandas, scipy, scikit-learn, matplotlib, uv. No GPU, no network calls, no weights file. 65 ms per window on one CPU core.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
222 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 146 0 R
/E (Pipeline: INGEST, CLASSIFY, PERIOD, BASIS, SELECT, FIT, PREDICT. Seven-day CSV in, 96 day-8 rows out on a 15-minute grid with a 1-sigma per column.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [10]
>>
