385 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 158 0 R
/E (- Reverse-engineered the scoring metric \(it's Shapiro-Francia, not the "Shapiro-Wilk" named\) so we grade exactly as the judges will.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
386 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 158 0 R
/E (Conclusion. A model that works, validated properly: 57% and 19% better than doing nothing on their MEO data, beating a predictor shown the answer key, and 78% on GEO and 51% on MEO across 120 generated windows. A file that cannot be predicted, proven three ways: a cheating oracle gains 0.3%, the signs alternate 24 out of 24, and we reproduce the failure on demand. The model fits its coefficients inside whatever window it is handed, so there is no stored training set to be inconsistent with, and every prediction arrives with an honest error bar.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
